  "name": "Hilton Los Angeles Airport",
  "hotelDescription": "<p><strong>Convenient Airport Shuttle Service</strong><br>Benefit from the free 24-hour shuttle service to Los Angeles International Airport, ensuring a stress-free start or end to your trip.</p><p><strong>Diverse Dining Options</strong><br>Indulge in a variety of culinary experiences with 4 food venues to choose from, including American cuisine at The Café and northern Italian dishes at Andiamo.</p><p><strong>Relaxing Amenities</strong><br>Unwind in the spacious outdoor pool and whirlpool, or enjoy a drink at Landings Bar. The modern rooms with cable TV and the on-site fitness center cater to all your needs.</p><p>Book your stay at Hilton Los Angeles Airport for a memorable and comfortable experience.</p>",
